  "title": "Mixpanel University Revamped: New Look, Improved Navigation, and Enhanced Search Features",
  "summary": "Mixpanel University just got a refresh 🎓 New look, cleaner navigation, better search, with the same great content and same URL: university.mixpanel.com (http://university.mixpanel.com). There are dozens of modules covering everything from initial setup to advanced analysis, plus certification paths if you want something more structured. All free and self-paced. If you had specific modules bookmarked, those URLs changed. Use search or browse from the homepage to find what you're looking for. Happy learning!",
